cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Battery Energy Storage System (BESS) Electro-Thermal & SoC Dynamics Solver"
message: "If you use this battery equivalent-circuit, state-estimation, BMS SOP, or degradation solver in academic, research, or engineering work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Haris
    family-names: Zafar
    alias: hariszafar740-lang
repository-code: "https://github.com/hariszafar740-lang/bess-soc-dynamics-solver"
url: "https://hariszafar740-lang.github.io/bess-soc-dynamics-solver/"
abstract: >-
  Installable Python simulation engine (bess_solver / bess-sim) for lithium-ion
  battery energy storage cells, combining 1RC and chemistry-parameterized 2RC
  equivalent-circuit dynamics (NMC811 & LFP), monotone PCHIP open-circuit
  potentials, Plett hysteresis, Bernardi reversible/irreversible heat, EIS
  Nyquist synthesis, closed-loop EKF/UKF SoC estimators, 2-node radial thermal
  & receding-horizon SOP BMS derating, and ASTM E1049-85 rainflow + virtual-age
  SEI/cycle/plating lifetime degradation.
keywords:
  - battery-energy-storage
  - lithium-ion
  - equivalent-circuit-model
  - kalman-filter
  - state-of-charge
  - state-of-power
  - rainflow-counting
  - battery-degradation
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-25"
